        "description": "- Turn-based tactics strategy game with a compelling single-player campaign and drop in / drop out multiplayer missions for up to 4 players.\n- 31 playfields across 3 diverse biomes. \n- Choose from 9 playable Squad members - Floor Model / Assassin / Vanguard / Ravager / Juggernaut / E-Goop / Ghost / Queen / Wildcard\n- Over-the-top futuristic weaponry includes laser swords, combat drones, lightning launchers, smart mines, nano-bots, and more.\n- Wagering system. The bigger the risks, the bigger the rewards!\n- Buy drinks at the bar. Throw them on the battlefield for added buffs.\n- Hyper-retro 90s aesthetic and a modern synthwave soundtrack featuring tracks by AM0k, Metasphere, Fynn’s Arcade, Hearts in Beta and Monster Mansion. \n\n\n",
